{"id":"n17371-2-14","stage":1,"title":"잔 · 酒杯","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17371-2-14-1","ko":"그동안 수고 많았네. 내 잔을 받게.","zh":"这段时间辛苦你了，来，我敬你一杯。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그동안","meaning":"近来，这段时间","explanation":"그동안：近来，这段时间","readings":[{"term":"그동안","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60236","senseId":"1","lemma":"그동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수고","meaning":"辛苦，受累","explanation":"수고：辛苦，受累","readings":[{"term":"수고","audio":"/audio/5fbed1b5bed3090038f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15619","senseId":"1","lemma":"수고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많았네.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잔을","meaning":"酒杯","explanation":"잔：酒杯；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잔","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17371","senseId":"2","lemma":"잔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받게.","meaning":"接，接受","explanation":"받다：接，接受；게：结合语境表示劝告、目的或反问等，常用于非敬语交谈。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"9","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d33dc138cdc9a561","term":"그동안","zh":"近来，这段时间","audio":"/audio/d33dc138cdc9a561307b.mp3","entryId":"60236","definition":"前面已经说过的那些时间；或指再次相逢或再次联系之前的一段时间。","pronunciation":["그동안"]},{"id":"5fbed1b5bed30900","term":"수고","zh":"辛苦，受累","audio":"/audio/5fbed1b5bed3090038f8.mp3","entryId":"15619","definition":"因做某事而出力、费心；或指那样的困难。","pronunciation":["수ː고"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"ca06065856b9c29b","term":"잔","zh":"酒杯","audio":"/audio/ca06065856b9c29b0c80.mp3","entryId":"17371","definition":"倒酒喝的小器具。","pronunciation":["잔"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接，接受","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到要求、申请、提问、攻击或信号等的作用，或指对这些做出反应。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/db742137c98836e4b044.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17371-2-14-2","ko":"네, 감사합니다.","zh":"好的，谢谢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감사합니다.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"감사하다：感谢，感激；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"감사하다","audio":"/audio/552d49e405b9383e0803.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71728","senseId":"1","lemma":"감사하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"552d49e405b9383e","term":"감사하다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/552d49e405b9383e0803.mp3","entryId":"71728","definition":"觉得感恩。","pronunciation":["감ː사하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a2109fd31a29a85efc70.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.058,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17371","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":32,"sequenceScore":1.4168,"q